window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Kairhyse: </b>My little demon has been taken again, but this time my journey to get her back is by far more dangerous than the last. My patience is none for those around me, that includes the man that is aiding Sydni and I in finding Xeraphine. Sacrifices will need to be made and I'm willing to give everything fate has for me to make sure I get her back.<br> <br> <b>Xeraphine: </b>My life has never been my own, even from the ripe age of three. I was born with one purpose, and one purpose only: To serve her. Except, what she's going to learn is I'm a stubborn bitch. I refuse to lay down and be treated like nothing more than a tool for a future I can't imagine without Kai. I just need to find the strength in me to fight, even if it's just for myself.</p> <p><b>PLEASE NOTE: When you purchase this title, the accompanying PDF will be available in your Audible Library along with the audio.</b></p>"; 
